const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"官方指引说明哪些机构、证券与申报安排属于Form 13F框架，以及如何通过EDGAR查找材料。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://www.sec.gov/divisions/investment/13ffaq.htm",label:{zh:"SEC Form 13F guidance · 来源说明",en:"SEC Form 13F guidance · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"这是一套披露与访问规则，而不是对机构真实持仓、动机或交易时点的完整观测设计。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://www.sec.gov/divisions/investment/13ffaq.htm",label:{zh:"SEC Form 13F guidance · 来源说明",en:"SEC Form 13F guidance · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"应保留申报人身份、报告期、提交与修订日期、证券范围、CUSIP映射和文件版本。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://www.sec.gov/divisions/investment/13ffaq.htm",label:{zh:"SEC Form 13F guidance · 来源说明",en:"SEC Form 13F guidance · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"资料可支持对已披露持仓的结构化研究，但公开申报的覆盖范围与时间滞后必须被视为数据合同的一部分。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://www.sec.gov/divisions/investment/13ffaq.htm",label:{zh:"SEC Form 13F guidance · 来源说明",en:"SEC Form 13F guidance · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"以提交时间而非报告期末作为可得性边界，保留修订文件，并验证证券标识和公司行动映射。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://www.sec.gov/divisions/investment/13ffaq.htm",label:{zh:"SEC Form 13F guidance · 来源说明",en:"SEC Form 13F guidance · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 SEC Form 13F guidance。13F并不等于完整投资组合、实时交易流或统一的基金持仓口径，缺失部分不能静默补齐。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites SEC Form 13F guidance for “Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://www.sec.gov/divisions/investment/13ffaq.htm",label:{zh:"SEC Form 13F guidance · 来源说明",en:"SEC Form 13F guidance · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。13F并不等于完整投资组合、实时交易流或统一的基金持仓口径，缺失部分不能静默补齐。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Form 13F: Official Filing Guidance and EDGAR Data Access”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
